      "• Enhanced Innovation: Includes all of Project A's innovative tests ('decline feedback,' 'pre-emptive information,' 'reverse notification') and adds one more: a test of a 'gradual disclosure' message format. This shows a slightly more nuanced and iterative approach to user-centric design, specifically testing ways to reduce information overload and potentially increase engagement.",
      "• Slightly More Comprehensive Evidence Plan: The addition of the 'gradual disclosure' test adds another data point (effect on user engagement/comprehension) to an already strong evidence plan, indicating a marginally deeper commitment to refining the user experience based on data."
